Output "docs/media/watch.gif"

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1080
Set Height 620
Set Padding 24
Set Framerate 15
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set CursorBlink false
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./qa/vhs_watch.sh"
Enter
Sleep 10s
